      "updatedAt": "2025-12-22T15:50:31Z",
      "closedAt": null,
      "comments": [
        {
          "author": "Progdrasil",
          "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
          "body": "In the [Extensions](https://fidoalliance.org/specs/cx/cxf-v1.0-ps-20250814.html#cddl-key-extension-name) section of CXF we defined using the rp_id as the prefix to custom extensions. we could do the same for credential types.\n\n* `company.com/<type>`\n* `company.com/<extension>`",
          "createdAt": "2025-12-22T15:50:31Z",
          "updatedAt": "2025-12-22T15:50:31Z"
        }
      ]
